## Merge upstream master (v0.9.1) into integration-0.9.0

Context:
integration-0.9.0 was 16 commits behind databrickslabs/ontobricks master
(v0.9.1 release: Dependabot security floors, Lakebase DQ on the Build
warehouse, Auto-Map metric-view SQL, viewer Graph Chat access, SWRL builtin
filters, docs split, .planning/ untracked with eval datasets moved to
tests/eval/datasets/). This merges master in; the version becomes 0.9.1.

Changes:
1. .planning/agents/agent_dtwin_chat/SPEC.md,
   .planning/agents/agent_owl_generator/SPEC.md,
   .planning/agents/agent_owl_generator/eval/dataset.jsonl
   Modify/delete conflicts resolved in favour of upstream: .planning/ is now
   git-ignored. Every dataset row this branch added is already present in
   tests/eval/datasets/agent_owl_generator/, so nothing is lost; the local
   copies stay on disk untracked.
2. src/agents/agent_auto_assignment/engine.py
   SYSTEM_PROMPT keeps both blocks: this branch's SUBCLASSES rule, then
   upstream's METRIC VIEW SOURCES rule.
3. src/agents/tools/mapping.py
   Keeps both helpers: this branch's _missing_attributes (attribute coverage
   check) and upstream's _metric_view_sql_error / _prepare_mapping_sql
   (metric-view SQL guard). The entity submit path uses both.
4. tests/units/front/i18n_untranslated_baseline.json
   Upstream rewrote the Help / About / Registry configuration prose for the
   Lakebase registry. The templates baseline gains the 22 new English
   fragments and drops the 4 that no longer exist ("Python 3.10+ & FastAPI",
   "), the REST", "not", "tab."), matching how earlier upstream copy was
   baselined.

Known follow-up:
- uv.lock does not satisfy the raised pyproject floors yet (`uv lock --check`
  fails). This is upstream's state ("lock regen pending"); installs keep using
  the pinned lock via `uv sync --frozen` / `uv run --frozen`.

